    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare fertility of crosses among named varieties with within-variety controls and identify any reproducible partial sterility. A single robust counterexample refutes universality; prevalence estimates test 'very general.'";
